# Phase <N> Plan

## Locked decisions

Lock at the top before any code lands. Changing a locked decision
mid-phase requires re-baselining the affected sub-phases.

- Verification harness: <e.g. vitest, pytest, go test, cargo test, bats, terraform validate, dbt test — name the runner(s)>
- Coverage / quality gate: <e.g. coverage ≥ 85, mutation score ≥ 60, contract tests pass, schema diff clean — pick the floor>
- Output rebaseline mode (if applicable): <e.g. snapshot per-test vs blanket update; OpenAPI dump vs hand-curated; SQL diff freeze>
- Issue tracker: <e.g. dossier markdown only / GitHub issues / linear / beads>
- Per-task covenant: one commit, `type(scope): subject (P<N>-Bxx)` (see `SPEC.md` and `references/COVENANT.md`)
- Push / PR / publish / deploy: NEVER without explicit user approval.
- Lens: <web | backend | cli | lib | data | infra | mobile | ml | none>
- <other invariants for this phase>

